From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 06:30:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] =?UTF-8?q?BlueOS:=20Launcher3:=200.7.1=20fixes=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20materials=20stay,=20real=20glass=20blur=20+=20blur?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20slider,=20Arona=20widget=20pat/gaze/chip/text,=20readable=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?new=20widgets,=20no=20reload=20on=20material=20change?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Our RemoteViews widgets are applied synchronously and re-dressed before any frame that lost the
material (reapply every minute, theme change); the blur is created from the attached window.
Arona widget: reply chip floats in the drag layer (crashed when it didn't fit the card), patting
claims the gesture from the pager and cancels the long press, she looks at touches anywhere
(BaseDragLayer → AronaGaze), text full / status / none, phrases over the day. Weather widget: the
digits like «Дата» (wght 600, primary). Icons: the theme reloads only when the plate changes.

Change-Id: I93f7a3912686090458f6e77d87e5e8c1c2c1283a
